    {
      "id": "partarticle",
      "icon": "🔗",
      "title": "Particles + the",
      "subtitle": "Partiċelli mal-artiklu — particle contractions",
      "intro": "When a particle meets the article 'l-', they fuse into one word. Example: bi + l → bil-, ġo + l → ġol-.",
      "items": [
        {
          "long": "ma' + l-",
          "short": "mal-",
          "en": "with the"
        },
        {
          "long": "ta' + l-",
          "short": "tal-",
          "en": "of the"
        },
        {
          "long": "sa + l-",
          "short": "sal-",
          "en": "until the / as far as the"
        },
        {
          "long": "ġo + l-",
          "short": "ġol-",
          "en": "in the"
        },
        {
          "long": "bi + l-",
          "short": "bil-",
          "en": "with the"
        },
        {
          "long": "fi + l-",
          "short": "fil-",
          "en": "in the"
        },
        {
          "long": "lil + l-",
          "short": "lill-",
          "en": "to the"
        },
        {
          "long": "bħal + l-",
          "short": "bħall-",
          "en": "like the"
        },
        {
          "long": "għal + l-",
          "short": "għall-",
          "en": "for the"
        },
        {
          "long": "minn + l-",
          "short": "mill-",
          "en": "from the"
        }
      ],
      "facts": [
        "These contractions still follow the 'Xemxin' consonant rule from Lesson 1.",
        "Before 'Xemxin' consonants (ċ, d, n, r, s, t, x, ż, z), the L assimilates: fil-xemx → fix-xemx; ġol-sodda → ġos-sodda.",
        "Before vowels, h, or għ — the particles bi, fi shorten to b' / f': fi dar → f'dar; bi ajruplan → b'ajruplan.",
        "The particles sa, ma', ta' may also shorten before vowels: sa Għawdex → s'Għawdex; ma' ommi → m'ommi."
      ],
      "exercises": [
        {
          "id": "ex3",
          "title": "Combine particle + article",
          "instructions": "Pick the correct contracted form for the gap.",
          "choices": [
            "sal-",
            "bil-",
            "ġol-",
            "lill-",
            "mill-",
            "fil-",
            "mal-",
            "tal-",
            "bħall-",
            "għall-"
          ],
          "items": [
            {
              "sentence": "Tom mar ___ pjazza",
              "en": "Tom went to the square",
              "answer": "sal-"
            },
            {
              "sentence": "Sara kelmitni ___ Malti ġenwin",
              "en": "Sara spoke to me with proper Maltese",
              "answer": "bil-"
            },
            {
              "sentence": "Ix-xita waqgħet ___ ġnien",
              "en": "The rain fell into the garden",
              "answer": "ġol-"
            },
            {
              "sentence": "Tajt ir-rigal ___ kuġina",
              "en": "I gave the gift to the cousin",
              "answer": "lill-"
            },
            {
              "sentence": "Tom ġej ___ ajruport",
              "en": "Tom is coming from the airport",
              "answer": "mill-"
            },
            {
              "sentence": "Iltqajna ___ kafetterija",
              "en": "We met at the café",
              "answer": "fil-"
            },
            {
              "sentence": "Marija marret ___ familja tagħha",
              "en": "Marija went with her family",
              "answer": "mal-"
            },
            {
              "sentence": "Dak l-arloġġ ___ nannu",
              "en": "That clock is grandpa's",
              "answer": "tal-"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
